{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Classes.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Classes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender operator classes blender operator classes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Classes.md","fileName":"Blender Operator Classes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Operator Classes","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-08 09:04\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Add-On Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Add-On Architecture","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Classes.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Classes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender operator classes blender operator classes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Classes.md","fileName":"Blender Operator Classes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Operator Classes","heading":"Blender Operator Classes","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A Blender operator class packages an action that can be registered with the application and invoked from the interface or through `bpy.ops`. It inherits from Blender's operator type, declares an identifier and label, and implements an `execute` method that receives the current context.\n\nThe identifier maps the class to an operator namespace and must follow Blender's naming rules. A successful execution reports completion, while class-level registration methods can create closely associated properties. The operator turns ordinary Python logic into an action Blender can discover and call consistently.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Add-On Architecture","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Classes.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Classes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender operator classes blender operator classes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Classes.md","fileName":"Blender Operator Classes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Operator Classes","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[blenderpythonapi.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Add-On Architecture","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}